## Open: whether a plan may draw from several specs [OPEN-DP-ALSO-FROM]

- part-of: [FL-DOC-PLAN]
- status: draft
- x-label: O3
- x-open: dp-also-from lets the FOR-LLMS.md plan reach the audience specs. Whether any other plan may use it, or whether a project-wide overview spec should be that plan's one source spec instead, is open.
- x-owner: The spec owner.

## Open: how an education level maps to a grade [OPEN-DP-READING-LEVEL-MAPPING]

- part-of: [FL-DOC-PLAN]
- status: draft
- x-label: O4
- x-open: The format records the education level in words and a target as a Flesch-Kincaid grade, and defines no mapping between them. The default tolerance of 0.5 and the minimum of five sentences are the architects' choice and have not been measured against real documents.
- x-owner: The spec owner, after the first real plan.

